{"updated":"2026-10-21T15:28:58.433Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Trump says AI data centres should pay ‘dividends’ in pre-midterm shift. Elsewhere, prosecutors search European Parliament offices of far-right Patriots bloc in graft probe. And film show: Olivia Colman, Alexander Skarsgård star in horny feminist fantasy 'Wicker'. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.3 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 1.7 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 38 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.4 near 192 km S of Burica, Panama. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.34,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.87,1.02,1.41,1.52,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.66,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.78,1.82,1.89,1.95,2,2.03,2.07,2.11,2.15,2.17,2.23,2.28,2.32,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.54,2.59,2.65,2.71,2.77,2.89,3.01,3.13,3.16,3.2,3.23,3.29,3.33,3.39,3.48,3.56,3.62,3.69,3.74,3.79,3.83,3.88,3.92,3.95,3.97,4.02,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.13,4.18,4.26,4.32,4.39,4.46,4.52,4.59,4.62,4.68,4.7,4.76,4.88,5.03,5.2,5.8,5.9,5.96,6.01,6.06,6.12,6.2,6.25,6.3,6.36,6.43,6.51,6.84,6.9,6.97,7.02,7.14,7.21,7.28,7.34,7.37,7.44,7.5,7.58,7.64,7.67,7.74,7.87,7.93,7.98,8.01,8.03,8.07,8.09,8.14,8.19,8.26,8.32,8.36,8.41,8.44,8.51,8.57,8.64,8.68,8.8,8.84,8.9,8.95,9.02,9.06,9.13,9.18,9.26,9.31,9.39,9.44,9.51,9.55,9.62,9.69,9.78,9.87,9.93,10,10.08,10.12,10.18,10.3,10.39,10.51,10.63,11.07,11.19,11.25,11.31,11.37,11.41,11.47,11.51,11.56,11.69,11.71,11.89,11.95,11.99,12.05,12.11,12.18,12.26,12.33,12.4,12.45,12.49,12.54,12.59,12.63,12.71,12.75,12.8,12.86,12.9,12.97,13.04,13.11,13.15,13.21,13.28,13.34,13.41,13.46,13.53,13.